  "source_findings": [
    "734600 dispatches the relevant controller index to the listed RMLpwr...IdleThresholdUs literal and reads into group+124+index*108. The Us suffix is source naming, not independent authoritative physical-unit or residency proof.",
    "B98AC0 receives parent LPWR in RDX and loads group=[parent+12C0] into RSI. For controller 4 or 12..15, B9AC66..B9AE66 checks controller support and copies a nonzero group field to the listed parent field. The 737120 controller-index switch reads the same parent field as the first default-generator input; the same mode-dependent conversion/rounding limits established for controller0 apply.",
    "Controller 17 can later overwrite parent+ABC after controller12; controller18 can overwrite +AF8 after13; controller19 can overwrite +B34 after14, if the respective alternate controller is supported and its own group value is nonzero. Thus the field is shared in source and current effective default is not attributed solely to 12/13/14. No claim is made that alternate controller support or override is active locally.",
    "Controllers 10 and 11 have direct RMLpwrMsDifrSwAsrIdleThresholdUs and RMLpwrMsDifrCgIdleThresholdUs group-row producers and 737120 first-default selectors parent+974/+978, respectively. No group-to-parent writer for these cases was identified in this bounded pass, so the same complete naming join is not claimed for 10/11.",
    "The live E802 type3 attribute3A common conversion accepts a selected controller index, but exact per-controller availability, factor, before/hold readback, peer and supported response must be checked through current adapter before treating any individual control as operational. No physical power or residency claim follows from the name."
  ],
